  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MyVirtualCommunity.Client.World.SecretContainmentArtifactDescriptor
  artifactId: artifact:cuaderno-paginas-selladas
  titleEs: "Cuaderno de P\xE1ginas Selladas"
  titleEn: Notebook of Sealed Pages
  loreEs: "Cuaderno de campo manchado por la humedad con diagramas t\xE9cnicos doblados
    y varias hojas pegadas entre s\xED. Sus m\xE1rgenes registran lecturas de un
    plano que no coincide con la superficie."
  loreEn: Water-damaged field notebook filled with folded technical diagrams and
    pages sealed together. Its margins log survey measurements that do not match
    the surface grid.
  accentColor: {r: 0.82, g: 0.84, b: 0.9, a: 1}
  inspectionScope: 0
